---
description: On-page SEO requirements for FiberCalc pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro
---
Unique title (≤60 rendered, including brand), meta description 120–160 (audit 50–165), one H1, canonical from siteConfig.siteUrl, OG tags (no og:image trailing slash), 40–60 word answer-first intro under H1, internal links including Learn more guides. Tools need WebApplication JSON-LD without fake ratings; guides need Article + FAQPage. See docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md.
